{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03051","headline":"林亭咏 · 张九龄","name":"林亭咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穿筑非求丽，幽闲欲寄情。\n偶怀因壤石，真意在蓬瀛。\n苔益山文古，池添竹气清。\n从兹果萧散，无事亦无营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}